    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start. But I think we need to be a bit more specific about the \"character\" of the people living there. The council is worried that the current demographic is... well, a bit of a hurdle for high-end retail and professional residents. \n\nHow would you describe the current resident profile in a way that subtly suggests the neighborhood lacks the \"refinement\" or \"stability\" needed for the new developments we're planning?",
